# Voice V3 legacy reuse (mandatory for V3 changes)

Read **`docs/VOICE-V3-LEGACY-REUSE-STANDARD.md`** before importing anything outside `src/lib/voice-v3/**` into a V3 tool or executor.

- Do not use `sendQuickSms`, `sendAppointmentSms`, or inbox/campaign helpers in V3 tool hot paths unless the full downstream graph is documented and approved.
- Prefer a **dedicated module** under `src/lib/voice-v3/<feature>/` + an **isolation script** that fails on forbidden imports.
- SEND_LINK transport: **`sendVoiceV3BookingLinkSms` only** — freeze gates in `docs/VOICE-V3-SEND-LINK-FREEZE-GATE.md`.
